{"sections":[{"slug":"GrothendieckGalois理论","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"GrothendieckGalois理论"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"Grothendieck Galois <span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">百科</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"Grothendieck Galois 理论"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"百科"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">观念</span></h2>\n<p>Grothendieck Galois <span lang=\"zh\">理论某种意义上提取出了一个连通</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">的</span> “<span lang=\"zh\">形状</span>” <span lang=\"zh\">的一阶同伦信息</span>.</p>\n<p>Grothendieck Galois <span lang=\"zh\">理论是如下理论的推广</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">域的</span> Galois <span lang=\"zh\">扩张</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/经典Galois理论","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">经典</span> Galois <span lang=\"zh\">理论</span>"}},{"Plain":");</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">拓扑空间的</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/Galois覆叠","text":"Galois <span lang=\"zh\">覆叠</span>"}},{"Plain":".</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">陈述</span></h2>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">设</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">为连通概形</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">则存在一个</span> "},{"Local":{"url":"/pro-有限群","text":"pro-<span lang=\"zh\">有限群</span>"}},{"Plain":" $\\pi_1(X)$ (<span lang=\"zh\">称为平展基本群</span>), <span lang=\"zh\">使得有限平展覆叠的范畴</span> $\\mathsf{FEt}_X$ <span lang=\"zh\">等价于有限</span> $\\pi_1(X)$-<span lang=\"zh\">集合的范畴</span> $\\mathsf{FinSet}_{\\pi_1(X)}$. <span lang=\"zh\">例如</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">个</span> $X$ <span lang=\"zh\">的无交并对应</span> $n$ <span lang=\"zh\">元集合上的平凡</span> $\\pi_1(X)$-<span lang=\"zh\">作用</span>.</p>\n<p>$\\pi_1(X)$ <span lang=\"zh\">在同构的意义下唯一</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">但实际上依赖于一个基点的选取</span>. <span lang=\"zh\">这个基点是通过</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/纤维函子","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">纤维函子</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">给出的</span>.</p>\n<p>…</p>\n<h2><span lang=\"zh\">例</span></h2>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">整数环的谱</span> $\\operatorname{Spec} \\mathbb{Z}$</h3>\n<p>$\\pi_1(\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb{Z})$ <span lang=\"zh\">是平凡的</span>, $\\operatorname{Spec}\\mathbb{Z}$ <span lang=\"zh\">没有非平凡的有限平展覆叠</span>.</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">见</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/扭结–素数类比","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">扭结</span>–<span lang=\"zh\">素数类比</span>"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n<h3><span lang=\"zh\">域的谱</span></h3>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">对于域</span> $K$, $\\pi_1(\\operatorname{Spec}K)$ <span lang=\"zh\">是</span> $K$ <span lang=\"zh\">的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/绝对Galois群","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">绝对</span> Galois <span lang=\"zh\">群</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n"}]}}}]}